  "body": "MAINLINE-041 complete, QUESTIONABLE/PROJECTION. The selected 022d section's own f=4 frame gives screened SF 1.133451 under the inherited 0.2-times-linear convention, versus the transferred 1.07. Actual tubes weigh 4361.909 kg (+178.319); the unchanged frame exceeds closure by 174.444 kg.\n\nPerfect nonlinear first sampled tangent loss is bracketed at 5.430880–5.430924. Smallest-algebraic continuation, independent shifted solves, a fresh random-start global solve and tangent finite differences pass. This is an ideal elastic limit, not material/joint collapse.\n\nBest-SF-at-closure search favors frequency 5 among frequencies 1–10. Fine-mesh witnesses give 1.143285 at 5% reserve and 1.083205 at 019 reserve. Required extreme SiC compression is 1.164235/1.145748 GPa. Tubes weigh 4263.218/4108.765 kg; actual end moments enter candidate-sized sleeve/bond demands. Film stiffness receives no resize credit.\n\nA conservative peak-compression local-shell sensitivity lowers those witnesses to 1.033223/0.978132. Bare pins have 480 roll mechanisms; filament-derived film tangents remain conditional. Eight NFIs cover material, local interaction, joints, membrane, imperfections, mass, model and search scope. Qualified SF/allowable/failure probability remain null.\n\nAll 17 numerical checks and 1162 package checks pass. Manifest pins 676 files; prior 026/026b/CHECK022d packages are unchanged. All 24 admitted jobs released; corrected assertion and usage-error receipts retained. No time budget. Brief names no successor; stopping.",
